0 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0286a59\" data-id=\"0286a59\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c36d99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8c36d99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><b>Medical Translation Expertise<\/b><\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97ddcc5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"97ddcc5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Medical translation refers to the translation of various documentation related to healthcare and life sciences industry. Inaccuracy and language barriers within medical field can cost lives, that is why professional medical translation services is in high demand now and is in fact a part of regulatory requirements for development, testing and approval of new drugs, vaccines, and various medical devices. Such translation requires precision and in-depth and up-to-date knowledge ad understanding of medicine and related disciplines.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-cd0dfdb elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"cd0dfdb\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7afeaca\" data-id=\"7afeaca\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2bd03aa elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2bd03aa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"851\" height=\"564\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/istock_000002024436small_bw.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1942\" alt=\"Electrocardiogram\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/istock_000002024436small_bw.jpg 851w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/istock_000002024436small_bw-300x199.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/istock_000002024436small_bw-768x509.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 851px) 100vw, 851px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-021d0d6\" data-id=\"021d0d6\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a2f425 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4a2f425\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Medical texts are very different in nature and ABC Language Solutions has extensive experience in translating and localizing them. Some examples of documents that we deal with on a daily basis include, but are not limited to:<\/p><ul><li>Prescriptions<\/li><li>Instructions for use of medical devices<\/li><li>Product inserts<\/li><li>Medical reports and descriptions<\/li><li>Clinical trials<\/li><li>Different medical papers<\/li><li>Informed consent forms for patients<\/li><li>Medical records<\/li><li>Specialized software and operation manuals for hospital equipment<\/li><li>Pharmacological studies<\/li><li>Case Report Forms (CRF)<\/li><li>Product labels, and many others&#8230;<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-842c2f7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"842c2f7\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-57a42f2\" data-id=\"57a42f2\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d479220 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d479220\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Accuracy and quality of medical translation is very important because only using quality and informative documents can guarantee the proper maintenance of equipment, safety and proper recovering of patients because any error can cost someone\u2019s life! \u00a0Our medical translation services can meet any requirements of our clients. Our translators are thoroughly selected based on their experience and their specific knowledge of the industry. They all have the required credentials and are highly experienced in medical translations.<\/p><p>Working with industry experts and professional medical translators, we provide a multitude of medical linguistic services such as proofreading, expert review, editing and back-translation, to ensure that you receive ready-to-use, high-quality translations. Because we use cutting-edge linguistic software, our translations are always accurate, consistent, and formatted to your specifications.\u00a0<\/p><p>Your success is only a few clicks away.\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/risk-free-offer\"><b><i><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">Discover what quality translation really means with our risk-free trial offer!<\/span>\u00a0<\/i><\/b><\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e2cb11f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e2cb11f\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7414f2f\" data-id=\"7414f2f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-573177a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"573177a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">HOW CAN WE HELP YOU?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c383037 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c383037\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column